OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Lennon statue could fetch
OL,4,A#100k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA life-size statue of John Lennon
OL,7,Fdisplayed on Liverpool's Penny Lane
OL,8,Fcould fetch up to #100,000 at auction.
OL,10,FThe bronze sculpture, created by the
OL,11,Flate artist Laura Lian, has stood
OL,12,Foutside St Barnabas Church since August
OL,13,F2022. After it is sold it will be
OL,14,Freplaced by a replica.
OL,16,FPenny Lane was made famous by the
OL,17,FBeatles' 1967 song of the same name.
OL,19,FOmega Auctions will offer the statue on
OL,20,F29 September, with an estimate of
OL,21,Fbetween #70,000 and #100,000.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
